{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120303","id":3863821267,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7mTTvT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120303","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120303.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120303.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120303","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120303/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120303/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120303/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/19b246bbeba5073d728eca532e2b942ffd32c85e","number":120303,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"GLTF: Fix blend shape weights and value tracks not being exported","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\nThe GLTF exporter exports blend shape tracks only if they are of `TYPE_BLEND_SHAPE`; If there are value tracks that modify the blend shape weights, they do not get exported. Checking for value tracks that modify `blend_shape/<shape>` in `_convert_animation` fixes the issue.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, we were not writing the initial blend shape weights to the gltf meshes, we were just putting `0.0f`; getting the initial weights from the mesh instance nodes when converting them fixes this.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser